Package: openhalodb-19
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, tzdata
Description: PostgreSQL 19 kernel with the OpenHalo MySQL protocol and SQL dialect
 OpenHalo combines PostgreSQL 19.0 with the preloaded aux_mysql 2.0
 extension. PostgreSQL and MySQL clients can read and write the same data.
 The server, clients, development files, contrib modules and LLVM JIT
 provider are installed together under /usr/halo-19.
